---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
---
<Layout title="Contact Us - StudyHelp" description="How to reach StudyHelp for support, account, or payment issues.">
  <Header active="contact" />

  <div class="content legal-content">
    <div class="legal-card">
      <h1>Contact Us</h1>
      <p class="updated">StudyHelp is operated by fdaytalk, based in Telangana, India.</p>

      <h2>Email</h2>
      <p>For any question, account issue, or payment problem, write to us at:</p>
      <p class="contact-email"><a href="mailto:studyhelp@fdaytalk.com">studyhelp@fdaytalk.com</a></p>

      <h2>Support Form</h2>
      <p>For account recovery, payment issues, or anything requiring account-specific details, our support form is the fastest way to reach us — it collects the right details up front so we can help without back-and-forth.</p>
      <a href="/support/" class="btn-block">Go to Support Form</a>

      <h2>What We Can Help With</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Forgotten passcode or account recovery</li>
        <li>Payment issues — failed payments, duplicate charges, or access not granted after a successful payment</li>
        <li>Questions about subject content or coverage</li>
        <li>General feedback or issues with the site</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Response Time</h2>
      <p>We aim to respond to support requests as quickly as possible. Since StudyHelp is a small, independently-run service, response times may vary, but genuine account and payment issues are prioritised.</p>

      <h2>Please Do Not Send</h2>
      <p>Never send your account passcode to us via email or the support form. We will never ask for it, and you never need to share it to get help.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <style>
    .legal-content {
      max-width: 760px;
    }
    .legal-card {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 40px 36px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 28px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    }
    html[data-theme="dark"] .legal-card {
      box-shadow: 0 4px 28px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }
    .legal-card h1 {
      font-size: 26px;
      margin: 0 0 4px;
    }
    .legal-card .updated {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin: 0 0 28px;
    }
    .legal-card h2 {
      font-size: 17px;
      margin: 28px 0 10px;
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .legal-card p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--text);
      margin: 0 0 14px;
    }
    .legal-card ul {
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      padding-left: 22px;
    }
    .legal-card li {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .legal-card a {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
    .contact-email a {
      font-size: 17px;
    }
    .btn-block {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 12px 22px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: 1px solid var(--accent);
      background: var(--accent-bg);
      color: var(--accent);
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 4px 0 8px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .legal-card {
        padding: 28px 20px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
